"Wdech nosem na 4 sekundy, wydech przez lekko zaciśnięte usta na 6. Powtórz 6 razy i zostaw ramiona luźno." = "Breathe in through your nose for 4 seconds, out through slightly pursed lips for 6. Repeat 6 times and keep your arms loose.";
